.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
node_modules/
.env
.env.local

*/private.json

config/private.json
**/config/private.json

# Financial source data. The expense-report-generation skill names
# private-data/ as the home for statement CSVs/PDFs, receipts, and generated
# reports. Because ~/.claude/skills/<skill> is a symlink into this repo, that
# directory would land inside the repo and be seen by git unless ignored here.
# Depth-anywhere, same reasoning as the cache rule below.
**/private-data/

# Skill-local API-response caches.
# The crawl-fetch-ingest skill writes Firecrawl / Tavily / Jina / OG.io
# responses to its cache/ subdir so the same firm's data is reused across
# multiple decks/memos. The skill's docs name this path as the cache root.
# Because ~/.claude/skills/<skill> is a symlink into this repo, the cache
# lands inside the repo and gets seen by git unless ignored here.
# Pattern is depth-anywhere — any future skill that adopts the same
# response-cache pattern is covered without a per-skill rule.
**/cache/
